  "id": "dbb6a3d021107e3bd4682a790f238a51",
  "name": {
   "zh": "2D 跟踪点 · TAPNext++",
   "en": "2D Tracks · TAPNext++"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "TAPNext 把「跟住任意一个点」这件事写成预测下一个 token，靠在网络里逐帧传状态来跟点；TAPNext++ 在它基础上微调，稳定跟点的时长长 40 倍，能跟过遮挡。这张卡默认撒 10×10＝100 个网格点，交付 Nuke 的 Tracker 节点。",
   "en": "TAPNext casts tracking any point as next-token prediction, tracking points by passing state frame by frame through the network; TAPNext++ fine-tunes it to track stably 40 times longer and through occlusions. This card scatters a 10×10 = 100 point grid by default and delivers a Nuke Tracker node."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "tracks2d",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
